{"about_the_game":"<strong>ZIC: Survival</strong> is a survival shooter where you feel The Zombie Apocalypse &amp; become The Undead Hunter! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.poster.avif?t=1728295840\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.webm?t=1728295840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.mp4?t=1728295840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The pandemic virus infected the entire crew and passengers of the airliner, which led to the fall of the aircraft. You are the only survivor in a plane crash who has not been touched by a zombie virus. After the fall, you woke up somewhere in the wild, around the walking dead and half-alive scientist... <br><br>Infection with a deadly virus has turned the world into an undead zone and now you have to survive in pandemic at all costs and find a way to stop the zombie apocalypse. And try not to die, otherwise humanity will be doomed. The plague must be stopped with weapons! Every dead man must be in the grave!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/481ebddd5ac7fb5013d7b0a9a8fc3ddd.avif?t=1728295840\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A fascinating story mode with interesting quests<br></li><li> Open wide world with crafting and building<br></li><li> Realistic change of the day/night \u2013 craft a torch for dark night!<br></li><li> A rich arsenal of weapons against zombies, from knife to rifle like in left 4 dead<br></li><li> Stylish cartoon graphics<br></li><li> Incredible soundtrack \u2013 immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the apocalypse</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1065210?t=1728295840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1065210?t=1728295840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728295840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728295840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Game has cartoon violence: our characters can bleed or be damaged. Sometimes there may be alcohol or a cigarette but it's only for making suitable atmosphere."},"detailed_description":"<strong>ZIC: Survival</strong> is a survival shooter where you feel The Zombie Apocalypse &amp; become The Undead Hunter! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.poster.avif?t=1728295840\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.webm?t=1728295840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/d19e2c37b7c0f4f97c89e0a9aeb0a696.mp4?t=1728295840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The pandemic virus infected the entire crew and passengers of the airliner, which led to the fall of the aircraft. You are the only survivor in a plane crash who has not been touched by a zombie virus. After the fall, you woke up somewhere in the wild, around the walking dead and half-alive scientist... <br><br>Infection with a deadly virus has turned the world into an undead zone and now you have to survive in pandemic at all costs and find a way to stop the zombie apocalypse. And try not to die, otherwise humanity will be doomed. The plague must be stopped with weapons! Every dead man must be in the grave!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/extras/481ebddd5ac7fb5013d7b0a9a8fc3ddd.avif?t=1728295840\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A fascinating story mode with interesting quests<br></li><li> Open wide world with crafting and building<br></li><li> Realistic change of the day/night \u2013 craft a torch for dark night!<br></li><li> A rich arsenal of weapons against zombies, from knife to rifle like in left 4 dead<br></li><li> Stylish cartoon graphics<br></li><li> Incredible soundtrack \u2013 immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the apocalypse</li></ul>","developers":["Megame LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065210/header.jpg?t=1728295840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1065210/224422/3c788ec0fdfb637c72bf1198dac1a0bd651d986b/1751183645/dash_av1.mpd?t=1561102128","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1065210/224422/3c788ec0fdfb637c72bf1198dac1a0bd651d986b/1751183645/dash_h264.mpd?t=1561102128","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1065210/224422/3c788ec0fdfb637c72bf1198dac1a0bd651d986b/1751183645/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1561102128","id":256751300,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256751300/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1561102128"}],"name":"ZIC: Survival","package_groups":